        "cooked": "<p>Two questions:</p><p>1) Am I reading it right that the flip side of alternate Gloomweaver, despite having 100 HP, basically nukes himself every turn (H damage and then H-2 damage)? So you just need to outlast him really?</p><p>2) If&nbsp;a card says, for example, \"All Cold Damage is increased by 1\" AND \"Does 1 Cold Damage,\" that card would do 2 Cold Damage, right?</p><p>Thanks.</p>",
