        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"drkrash1969\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/eada6e/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> drkrash1969:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Two questions:1) Am I reading it right that the flip side of alternate Gloomweaver, despite having 100 HP, basically nukes himself every turn (H damage and then H-2 damage)? So you just need to outlast him really?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Correct. Of course, he also heals himself.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"drkrash1969\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/eada6e/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> drkrash1969:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<ol start=\"2\">\n<li>If&nbsp;a card says, for example, \"All Cold Damage is increased by 1\" AND \"Does 1 Cold Damage,\" that card would do 2 Cold Damage, right?Thanks.</li>\n</ol>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yes</p>",
